# The build context is `server/` and the image needs exactly two things out of it:
# requirements.txt and app/.  Everything else is excluded -- in particular tests/, which
# holds the owner's own 256 KB save fixture.  A player's save is not service code and must
# not travel inside a container image that might be shared.
tests/
tools/
data/
*.md
docker-compose.yml
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.sqlite
*.sav
.pytest_cache/
